        "quote_WJrjJE": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "logo_width": 100,
            "author": "",
            "content": "Thank you immensely for the comprehensive report. I recognize the significant effort you and your team have invested in it. Gaining deeper insight into myself and understanding the roots of my challenges is invaluable to me. The report is both thorough and enlightening. I plan to share it with my therapist in hopes of making meaningful progress on these issues. Again, thank you very much.",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "quote_9VWHb7": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "logo_width": 100,
            "author": "",
            "content": "Dr Seravalle is wonderful! Her attention to detail and understanding of testing information is wonderful. I appreciated that she would let the testing and scores be her guide in helping to determine, what, if any, additional testing was recommended. We couldn't be happier with the invaluable information she helped us to gather.",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "quote_t8zQxF": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "logo_width": 100,
            "author": "- Mrs. Jane",
            "content": "Jada is incredibly kind and understanding. She has a lot of empathy for the families and clients who come through the door. She is very thorough and always follows through.",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "quote_dLYYUT": {
          "type": "quote",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "logo_width": 100,
            "author": "",
            "content": "Having worked with Dr. Serravalle I am very confident that her practice and her team are highly trained, skilled, and equipped to help patients in the same or similar ways that she helped me. I felt like I received comprehensive and well-rounded treatment - of course related to my diagnosis but I also felt like I came out of therapy each session more connected to myself and more in tune with who I was and now am as a person. I would not be where I am in my life were it not for the time I spent working with Dr. Serravalle. The understanding of myself led to having such confidence in myself and that is invaluable.",
            "show_rating": false,
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "quote_NQAxPM": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "logo_width": 100,
            "author": "",
            "content": "Dr. Serrevalle was very welcoming and friendly. She put me at ease and helped me with practices to calm myself and let go of my anger and sadness.",
